job_post:
Overview

As a Node.js Developer, you will be responsible for delivering effective solutions with high-quality code. You will join a culturally diverse team, working in Scrum with CI/CD, in the spirit of the ‘fail fast, fail often’ agile concept.

If you’re interested in taking this challenging career opportunity within a growing international company, you’ll join a professional team. The development team uses a sophisticated tech stack with Node.js on the back end and React on the front end.

/*This is an on-demand, project/contract-based position. We will start cooperation as soon as we'll have a suitable project for you. 
Please attach your CV to your application.
If you read that please start your message with the word "April". Thank you */

Job Requirements

We're looking for engineers who have experience with the core of our tech stack, which includes ES6 JavaScript and/or TypeScript, Node.js, AWS, and MongoDB.

Experience with Node.js (minimum 3 years);
Experience with PHP (will be a plus).
Database design and management experience with MongoDB, MySQL or PostgreSQL;
Understanding of monitoring, error handling and problem-solving skills to handle minor and major errors;
Knowledge of Agile/ Scrum/ Kanban;
Attention to detail, responsibility, and ambition to achieve your mission;
A good combination of rigour, creativity, and communication skills;
Able to work as part of a team, collaborate and build strong working relationships;
Good level of English.

Good command of:

D
